      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DOTTIE KEEPING (3) has a strong record this track and trip including three wins from four starts. Scored by 1.75 lengths last time (22.30) in a Free For All over 400m at this track. Rates on top and should go close. BOLT OF FUN (1) shapes well for this on her slick win a few runs back, getting around this track over 400m in 22.37 then hitting the frame in both runs since. Expecting another bold showing. HONG KONG PHOOEY (2) gave a start and overcame a chequered run to finish into the minors when a 3.5 lengths third (22.52) at this track in a Free For All. Should be in this for a long way. JUST A DUKE (8) drops in distance and can play a major role.",
